This repository contains QuoteMem's own source code: the Python memory service
(src/quotemem), the agent adapters and MCP server of the npm package quotemem
(integrations/), and two benchmark source manifests. It includes HeavenBase
(below) and no other third-party code or benchmark data.

The npm package has no runtime dependencies. Its DSH bundle declares
@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm, @deepseek-ai/dsh-session and @deepseek-ai/schemastery as
optional peer dependencies, which DSH itself provides; they are not bundled.

Runtime dependencies
--------------------
QuoteMem installs its dependencies from the Python Package Index; each keeps
its own licence. The direct dependencies are anyio, cryptography, httpx,
numpy, pydantic, pyyaml, sqlalchemy, starlette and uvicorn (plus pywin32 on
Windows, and pyarrow and tiktoken for the optional "bench" extra), and those
of HeavenBase: anthropic, click, cloudpickle, fastmcp, omegaconf, openai,
pandas, prompt_toolkit and typer.

Included software
-----------------
src/quotemem/_vendor holds a pre-release build of HeavenBase 0.1.2.3 (the
project: https://pypi.org/project/heavenbase/) - MIT License. The package
folder is unmodified, from heavenbase-0.1.2.3-py3-none-any.whl with SHA-256
3fcbeacfeb1446900db06582e28512b9d98540204c7b45c587849ad9b44bf4e4; its
dist-info folder holds only the metadata headers and the licence. The
copyright and permission notice are in
src/quotemem/_vendor/heavenbase-0.1.2.3.dist-info/licenses/LICENSE.

Benchmark sources (not redistributed)
-------------------------------------
benchmarks/sources.json and benchmarks/sources-additional.json list public
benchmark files by URL, pinned revision, SHA-256 and licence. The benchmark
tool downloads them from their publishers; no benchmark content is stored in
this repository. Users must follow each dataset's licence:

  LoCoMo-Refined (mem-eval-suite/LoCoMo_refined, revision 8870911),
    derived from LoCoMo (Snap Research, ACL 2024) - CC BY-NC 4.0,
    non-commercial use only.
  LongMemEval (xiaowu0162/longmemeval-cleaned, revision 98d7416) - MIT.
  BEAM (mohammadtavakoli78/BEAM, revision b2da22e) - data listed under
    CC BY-SA 4.0 in benchmarks/sources-additional.json; code MIT,
    Copyright (c) 2025 Mohammad Tavakoli.
  MemoryAgentBench (ai-hyz/MemoryAgentBench, revision 7ea0669) - MIT.

Optional baseline
-----------------
The benchmark tool can compare against Mem0 (mem0ai, Apache License 2.0) when
the user installs it separately. No Mem0 code is included.
